<% content_for :title, "ForgeCart - home" %>
<h1>Welcome to ForgeCart</h1>
<p>ForgeCart is a Shopify-style merchant storefront: shoppers browse and search
the catalog, and the merchant manages customers, product imports and webhook
deliveries from the admin.</p>
<h2>Storefront</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/cart">Cart</a></li>
  <li><a href="/catalog">Catalog</a> (illustrative lab endpoints)</li>
  <li><a href="/products">Products</a></li>
  <li><a href="/search">Search</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>Merchant admin</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/admin">Dashboard</a></li>
  <li><a href="/admin/customers/update">Edit customer</a></li>
  <li><a href="/admin/orders">Orders</a></li>
  <li><a href="/admin/products/import">Import products</a></li>
  <li><a href="/webhooks/customers/update">Webhook: customers/update</a></li>
  <li><a href="/webhooks/orders/create">Webhook: orders/create</a></li>
</ul>
